xpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-17T11:54:00-07:00","id":1522716,"title":"","content":"I have added two more sections of Charms: Accuracy and Reaction. Let me know what you think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T20:01:05-07:00","id":1523333,"title":"","content":"I'm Liking what I'm reading. This convertion is getting really good. <br /> BTW forged by purpose is a very good name.. its totally Alchemicals Motto<br /> <br /> I will spit out a few design sugestions okay? Could you please....<br /> <br /> &gt; Create a fast Index with Gdocs Styles. Its faster to read and navegate your documment. And can be updated with just one click.<br /> &gt; Use the 2ed terminolgy for Charm Groups... Damage Charms would be called Combat Charms.<br /> &gt; Use colors to highlight changing chapters or subjects, my mind goes dizzy triyng to find the &quot;Accuracy Charms&quot; session. Make it bigger or paint it red or other bright color.<br /> <br /> I'm creating an Alchemical for a MixedExalts game my friends are playing and your documment is really helping me a lot =)<br /> I'm Subscribing this post to keep following your great work =D<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you like Alchemicals, please check out my DeviantArt Gallery!! <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> - 5 Magic Materials BeamKlaves and Gyroscopic Chakrans ? OK<br /> - Autochthonia updated World Map? OK<br /> And many more! <a href=\"http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals\" target=\"_blank\">http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2498-yukiartic","name":"Yukiartic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T19:24:03-07:00","id":1523386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yukiartic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach?p=1523333#post1523333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm Liking what I'm reading. This convertion is getting really good.<br /> BTW forged by purpose is a very good name.. its totally Alchemicals Motto</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &gt; Create a fast Index with Gdocs Styles. Its faster to read and navegate your documment. And can be updated with just one click. </div> </div> </div>I'll look into it. I wasn't aware that was an option. I make heavy use of the document outline myself as a way to navigate.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &gt; Use the 2ed terminolgy for Charm Groups... Damage Charms would be called Combat Charms. </div> </div> </div>I'm going to have to say no to this one. The size of the Charm suite that Third Edition demands makes for quite the large set of combat Charms. Breaking it down into sub categories makes it more navigable and easier for me to design.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &gt; Use colors to highlight changing chapters or subjects, my mind goes dizzy triyng to find the &quot;Accuracy Charms&quot; session. Make it bigger or paint it red or other bright color. </div> </div> </div>I'll set off the headings in the Charms section with some lines. That should help.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm creating an Alchemical for a MixedExalts game my friends are playing and your documment is really helping me a lot =)<br /> I'm Subscribing this post to keep following your great work =D<br /> </div> </div> </div>Glad to hear it! Expect the Resilience Charms sometime in the next week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-08T20:05:26-07:00","id":1523858,"title":"","content":"Resilience and Sensory Charms are up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" targe